<workout_file>
    <author>Coach Claude</author>
    <name>Race Power Aero — 2x25 + 35</name>
    <description>Fri Aug 21. Makes up the aero session lost Wednesday to the drivetrain. SET FTP TO 185.

2x25min at ~161W in full aero, 8min between, then a 35min Z2 block also in aero. 85 MINUTES TOTAL IN POSITION - track that number against race day's 2h36.

THE POSITION IS THE SESSION. Power is moderate on purpose - RPE 5.5-6.5 throughout. What you are training is holding aero without coming up. Race day is 2h36 of it, and the legs are never what fails: it is the neck, shoulders, hip flexors and saddle. Only time in position fixes that, and it is where the remaining 2-3 minutes of the sub-5 bike split has to come from.

The closing 35min Z2 block is deliberately in aero too. Holding position when the effort is easy but you have already been down for an hour is closer to race-day hour three than the hard blocks are.

DO NOT COME UP during any block. If you have to, note the minute. That number is the output of this session and it should climb every week.

GEARING: still stuck in the small gear, so expect harsh ERG feel and a poor cadence reading. The Kickr measures power directly so the watts are fine - ignore the RPM number. Get the shifting fixed before Aug 29.

TOMORROW IS THE 13mi LONG RUN with 30min at race pace. Do not overcook this.

EAT: 40-60g carb across the ride. AFTER: 75-90g carb + 30-40g protein within 60min.</description>
    <sportType>bike</sportType>
    <tags>
        <tag name="racepower"/>
        <tag name="aero"/>
        <tag name="703"/>
    </tags>
    <workout>
        <Warmup Duration="900" PowerLow="0.50" PowerHigh="0.72" Cadence="90">
            <textevent timeoffset="10" message="2hr: 15 warmup, 2x25 at 161W aero, then 35min Z2 aero. 85min in position"/>
            <textevent timeoffset="180" message="HIDE THE HR FIELD. Watts and RPE only. Ignore the cadence number too"/>
            <textevent timeoffset="600" message="Into aero now, stay down for the rest of the warmup"/>
            <textevent timeoffset="840" message="Setup check: forearms flat, elbows narrow, back flat, head low"/>
        </Warmup>

        <SteadyState Duration="1500" Power="0.87" Cadence="88">
            <textevent timeoffset="10" message="Block 1 of 2. 25min at 161W. AERO the whole way"/>
            <textevent timeoffset="180" message="Shoulders forward and down, not shrugged up"/>
            <textevent timeoffset="600" message="Look up with your EYES, not by lifting your head"/>
            <textevent timeoffset="750" message="Halfway. Where is the discomfort - neck, shoulders, hips, saddle?"/>
            <textevent timeoffset="1200" message="20min in. This is where race day starts to bite. Stay down"/>
            <textevent timeoffset="1440" message="Last minute of block 1"/>
        </SteadyState>

        <SteadyState Duration="480" Power="0.55" Cadence="85">
            <textevent timeoffset="10" message="8min easy. Sit up, drink, eat. Roll the shoulders out"/>
            <textevent timeoffset="300" message="Stay down for all 25? If not, what minute did you come up?"/>
            <textevent timeoffset="420" message="Back into aero for the last 60s"/>
        </SteadyState>

        <SteadyState Duration="1500" Power="0.87" Cadence="88">
            <textevent timeoffset="10" message="Block 2 of 2. Same power, same position"/>
            <textevent timeoffset="300" message="Second block is the one that counts - fatigue breaks position, not power"/>
            <textevent timeoffset="750" message="Halfway. Still holding the bars?"/>
            <textevent timeoffset="1320" message="3min left. On race day you would have 90min still to go"/>
            <textevent timeoffset="1440" message="Final minute"/>
        </SteadyState>

        <SteadyState Duration="300" Power="0.55" Cadence="85">
            <textevent timeoffset="10" message="5min easy. Eat. One block left and it is the easy one"/>
        </SteadyState>

        <SteadyState Duration="2100" Power="0.70" Cadence="90">
            <textevent timeoffset="10" message="35min Z2 at 130W - but STAY IN AERO. This is the race-hour-three block"/>
            <textevent timeoffset="480" message="Easy power, hard position. That combination is the whole point"/>
            <textevent timeoffset="1200" message="20min in. Legs are fine - it is the neck and shoulders talking now"/>
            <textevent timeoffset="1500" message="10min left. Sit up only if you genuinely have to, and note the minute"/>
            <textevent timeoffset="1900" message="Nearly there. Total time down today is the number that matters"/>
        </SteadyState>

        <Cooldown Duration="420" PowerLow="0.62" PowerHigh="0.45" Cadence="85">
            <textevent timeoffset="10" message="7min down. Sit up, stretch neck and hip flexors"/>
            <textevent timeoffset="180" message="LOG IT: longest unbroken time in aero, and what hurt first"/>
            <textevent timeoffset="360" message="75-90g carb + 30-40g protein. 13mi long run tomorrow"/>
        </Cooldown>
    </workout>
</workout_file>
